{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2023-05-10 10:15:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.725 PER SHARE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR)\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.725 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 6, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2023.'}